    "body": "I really think that fastmath should be off by default. Her are a few hundreds of reasons (at least on CPU, but I assume that CUDA is similar): https://simonbyrne.github.io/notes/fastmath/\r\nAlso, here's the issue where they decided to turn off fast math by default in Julia: https://github.com/JuliaLang/julia/pull/41607#issuecomment-897887059",
